        <title type="html"><![CDATA[CSP sandbox allow-same-origin - clarify]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40489</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40489"/>
        <updated>2025-07-25T02:42:35.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">If found the description of the CSP sandbox value <code class="notranslate">allow-same-origin</code> to be a little confusing. This rewords to match the pattern of the other values, and adds the note that the <code class="notranslate">Origin</code> header will be null if this is not set.</p>
<p dir="auto">This fell out of reviewing <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3179678765" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40093" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40093/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40093">#40093</a></p>
